title: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Verify › More samples: checks that need a look
route: /authorizations/eligibility/verify
intro: 'More samples' opens a second row, 'Needs a look', with five chips. Each fills the form with a made-up member whose check ends with a warning, so every exception can be seen without a trick. A sixth, a check that cannot run at all, happens when Verify is paused in Settings. The last four digits of the member ID script the answer, as for the first six chips.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the endings are scripted. The warnings are the same ones New Case shows in step 2, because both read the same verification record.
---
start s1 "On 'Verify a patient', click 'More samples'"
screen sc "Row 'Needs a look' with five chips\n'Payer changed', 'Member ID mismatch', 'Benefit not confirmed',\n'Provider not confirmed', 'Requirement unknown'\nA note: 'To see a check that cannot run, pause Verify in Settings.'"
click c0 "Click 'Fewer samples' to fold the row again"
decision q1 "Click which chip?"

group gPick "What each chip fills in"
  process p1 "'Payer changed'\nSummit Medicaid HMO, Residential 3.5, member ending 7070"
  process p2 "'Member ID mismatch'\nCardinal Health Plan, IOP, member ending 8080"
  process p3 "'Benefit not confirmed'\nHarborview MA, PHP, member ending 5050"
  process p4 "'Provider not confirmed'\nLakeshore Behavioral, IOP, member ending 4040"
  process p5 "'Requirement unknown'\nBeacon PPO, Residential 3.5, member ending 2020"
endgroup

process pf "The form is filled, the chip turns green, 'Check now' is on\nThe row stays open while one of its chips is picked"
click c1 "Click 'Check now'"
process ck "The live check runs. The member ID ending decides the answer"

group gRes "Result"
  screen r1 "'Fix before billing: coverage ended 09/30, the member is with Cardinal now.'\nWarnings: 'Coverage is not active', 'The payer changed'\n'Start the request with the new plan.'"
  screen r2 "'Fix before billing: coverage is active, but under another member ID.'\nEligibility 'Needs a fix', 'Active, under the member ID ending 5521'\nWarning 'Member ID does not match'"
  screen r3 "'Fix before billing: the service is not confirmed.'\nBenefits 'Not confirmed'\nWarning 'Benefit not confirmed. Caller can confirm the benefit by phone.'"
  screen r4 "'Fix before billing: the clinic's enrollment is not confirmed.'\nWarning 'Provider participation not confirmed. Navigator can check the enrollment record.'"
  screen r5 "'Covered, but we do not know whether it needs an authorization.'\n'What this service needs' says 'No rule on file for Beacon and residential 3.5. Check with Beacon.'\nWarning 'Authorization requirement unknown'"
endgroup

store st "The check is saved as a verification record for the site in view\nIt is a row on the list at once, and New Case can find it"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › The exceptions"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › The shared verification record"

s1 --> sc --> q1
sc -.-> c0
q1 -->|Payer changed| p1 --> pf
q1 -->|Member ID mismatch| p2 --> pf
q1 -->|Benefit not confirmed| p3 --> pf
q1 -->|Provider not confirmed| p4 --> pf
q1 -->|Requirement unknown| p5 --> pf
pf --> c1 --> ck
ck -->|Ends 7070| r1
ck -->|Ends 8080| r2
ck -->|Ends 5050| r3
ck -->|Ends 4040| r4
ck -->|Ends 2020| r5
r1 & r2 & r3 & r4 & r5 --> st --> g2
r1 & r2 & r3 & r4 & r5 -.-> g1
